{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "5a",
 "name": "Knife Clan",
 "file": "Map5a_Knife_Clan.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":0,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Deep Forest","descriptions":["Broken and trampled branches are the only signs of a trail winding through this large bramble patch.  The torn and bloody remnants of a cloak snagged on the sharp bramble needles mark a failed attempt to forge a new path."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":2,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":2,"x":0,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Dense Forest","descriptions":["Large clumps of evergreen whortleberry bushes grow among the trees here, their deep green branches laden with blue-black berries."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":0,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":0,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":0,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go brambles"},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go bramble"}],"linksTo":"Map4_Crossing_WestGate.xml"},
  {"id":3,"x":20,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Deep Forest","descriptions":["A large bramble patch seems to block any hope of movement to the south.  In the thick loam beneath the trees a barely visible path heads northeast."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":"go patch"}]},
  {"id":4,"x":40,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Deep Forest","descriptions":["The trees thin out a little here giving more light to the undergrowth.  Several clusters of bright red, sharp yellow and deep blue flowers help break up the green and brown monotony of the forest.  To the north through the tree tops some mountain peaks are barely visible."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":3,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":5,"x":40,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Deep Forest","descriptions":["A jagged stump as large around as a table sticks dangerously out of the ground.  It looks as if a group of mad lumberjacks hacked at a tree with hand axes before the upper portion finally ripped away from the stump.  Leading from the stump, deep ruts in the ground head northeast."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":4,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":60,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Deep Forest","descriptions":["The path is marred with deep ruts which lead to the ragged end of a large felled tree.  Some of the tree's branches have gotten caught on the surrounding bushes preventing it from being dragged any further. Fortunately, the tree was shoved somewhat off the northern side of path giving barely enough room to continue northeast."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":5,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":8,"exit":"climb","move":"climb tree"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":80,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Deep Forest","descriptions":["The path disappears here amid small bushes and tall trees.  High overhead, a battered hip boot swings casually in the wind apparently caught at the ankle by a snare.  More tripped, but empty snares dangle from various tree limbs, silent testimony to their makers lack of skill."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":8,"x":40,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Deep Forest","descriptions":["A group of squirrels cavorts in the undergrowth and dry leaves.  Suddenly one of them dashes part way up a tree, only to be soundly chittered at by the others.  He dives down among them, rolling several end over end, before disappearing into a bush."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":6,"exit":"climb","move":"climb tree"}]},
  {"id":9,"x":20,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Deep Forest","descriptions":["Nestled beneath some large ferns, an old lean-to offers a little protection from the elements.  In front of it, a well-used fire pit and a poorly hidden cache of fire wood suggests that there are frequent visitors here."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":10,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":0,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Deep Forest","descriptions":["Hundreds of bees fly in and out of this area, at times coming dangerously close.  Their activity seems to be centered around a hollowed trunk which they've converted into a Gor'tog-sized hive."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":11,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":11,"x":-20,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Deep Forest","descriptions":["To the north, the dense forest is interrupted by a dry creek bed running roughly east and west.  The edge of the creek has eroded creating a gentle slope down to the bed."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":12,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":12,"x":-20,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Dry Creek Bed","descriptions":["It's been some time since water has flowed through this creek bed.  The hollows and low points of the bed have filled with leaves and dirt.  The southern lip of the creek has eroded creating a gentle slope up."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":14,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":11,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":0,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Dry Creek Bed","descriptions":["Completely oblivious to any other activity, a pair of ravens argue over a single shiny rock embedded in the creek bed.  At various times, each one manages to land briefly and work at prying the stone loose before the other swoops down and knocks its competitor away."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":12,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":14,"x":-40,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Dry Creek Bed","descriptions":["In sharp contrast to the thriving forest to the north and south, a small, lanky flowering bush clings to life on the rocky bed.  Though sunlight is plentiful, there is barely enough soil or water to sustain it."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":15,"x":-60,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Dry Creek Bed","descriptions":["From the west, the sounds of flowing water and a flash of blue indicate that a river is close by.  The silt and sand partially covering the creek bed and a few small pockets of fresh water suggest that the river level sometimes raises enough to allow water up this far."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":16,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":16,"x":-80,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, River's Edge","descriptions":["A wide band of smooth rocks and pebbles runs between the placid river to the west and the dense forest to the east.  When the river is at its fullest, this area is probably underwater.  A couple of fishing poles have been propped up near the water's edge, their lines trailing far downstream."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"east","move":"east"}]},
  {"id":17,"x":20,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Dry Creek Bed","descriptions":["Dusty footprints weave back and forth between the banks of the creek bed.  The partly exposed roots of a tree up on the north bank serve as a reminder that once water flowed swiftly through here."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":13,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":23,"exit":"climb","move":"climb root"}]},
  {"id":18,"x":40,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest Fen","descriptions":["The ground slopes abruptly down from the creek bed into a small fen.  Once a large pond, a slow decrease in water has allowed marsh grasses and flowers to flourish.  The sounds of crickets and frogs fill the air with a pleasant melody."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":21,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":19,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":17,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":19,"x":60,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest Fen","descriptions":["The foul smell of long standing water and decaying plants fills the air.  A boot lies half buried in the thick, goopy mud that covers the area.  To the north, a mountain range looms over the tree tops."],"exits":[{"to":21,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":20,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":18,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":20,"x":80,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest Fen","descriptions":["The remnants of a beaver dam occupy much of this area.  Marsh grasses and a few small bushes push up through the graying tangle of tree branches and sapling trunks.  Amid the wreckage are signs of bird nests and small animal burrows."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":21,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":22,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":21,"x":60,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest Fen","descriptions":["A shallow algae-filled pond occupies the center of this area.  Dragonflies buzz around, darting up and down over the water before disappearing amid the tall marsh grass.  To the north, the upper peaks of the mountains can barely be seen above the forest."],"exits":[{"to":22,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":20,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":19,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":18,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":22,"x":60,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest Fen","descriptions":["The forest to the north is eagerly encroaching on the marsh grasses and flowers.  Several young saplings compete for sunlight and air with a variety of bushes."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":21,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":18,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":23,"x":40,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["A high bank overlooks the dry creek bed to the south. At some point the bank eroded, partially exposing the roots of a tall satinwood.  When the breeze tugs at the tree's upper canopy, the tree creaks ominously and the ground shudders slightly."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":17,"exit":"climb","move":"climb root"}]},
  {"id":24,"x":40,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["The air is heavy with the vanilla-sweet smell of some flowering bushes that cover the area.  Hummingbirds dart among the pale yellow flowers, stopping now and again for a sip of nectar."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":23,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":60,"y":-260,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["The trees line both sides of the path, arching together to form a mottled green canopy overhead that looks more like the ceiling of an elaborate temple.  Flowers and ferns carpet the area beneath the trees."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":24,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":26,"x":80,"y":-280,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["A few blackened tree trunks stand in a large burned out area.  The tallest among them has been split in two apparently by a lightning bolt.  Half the trunk remains standing while the other half lies twisted and scarred among the burned out undergrowth."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":25,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":27,"x":80,"y":-300,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["A large wilted bramble bush looks oddly out of place among the ferns and satinwood trees in the area.  Even more odd, what looks like its roots, still partially covered in dirt, stick out from the top of the bush."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":26,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":29,"exit":"go","move":"go bush"}]},
  {"id":28,"x":100,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["The path ends suddenly in a large pit.  Part of the pit is covered by a motley arrangement of tree branches barely concealed by a thin layer of dirt, leaves, and uprooted bushes.  At the bottom of the pit, sharpened poles and jagged edged rocks point ominously upwards."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":29,"x":80,"y":-320,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["The southern end of the path disappears abruptly under a large wilted bramble bush.  A few shriveled berries and flowers still cling to the bush.  Around it, the other vegetation grows strong and lush beneath the satinwood trees."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":"go bush"}]},
  {"id":30,"x":60,"y":-340,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["Bramble bushes compete with cinnamon ferns for light and space between the trees.  Something has been helping the ferns along by ripping out and discarding some of the larger bushes."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":29,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":60,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["The tall trees thin out, allowing the mountain range to the north to come suddenly into view.  In the forefront a long ridge heads sharply up towards the closest peak.  In the far distance to the east, the top of a smoking volcano can barely be seen."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":32,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":32,"x":40,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["Crude drawings of hunts, battles, and weapons cover a large outcropping of rocks.  Those drawn with chalk or paint are faded and partially gone, while others, carved into the surface, seemed destined to last forever."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":33,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":35,"exit":"go","move":"go outcrop"}]},
  {"id":33,"x":20,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["A loud crashing and thrashing from the bushes startles you.  Suddenly, several deer come leaping across the area.  In the distance can be heard a cougar's snarl, then an all too-brief bleating."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":34,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":34,"x":0,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Forest","descriptions":["The path again disappears as the bushes and other undergrowth close in beneath the trees."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"}]},
  {"id":35,"x":20,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Sparse Forest","descriptions":["The rocky outcropping contains a small pocket of fresh water.  Around the water, bold red and creamy white lilies flourish.  Tracks of animals large and small can be seen in the mud at the water's edge."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":32,"exit":"go","move":"go outcrop"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":40,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Sparse Forest","descriptions":["The path threads its way through, over, and around large rocks and boulders.  If it weren't for the looming ridge to the north, it would be difficult to keep track of directions."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":35,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":37,"x":60,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Sparse Forest","descriptions":["Part of the ridge has given way, partially covering the path.  A wedge of land slid down the side a little way, leaving the trees and bushes in the wedge still standing, while those at the edge lean precariously at different angles."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":36,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":38,"x":80,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Sparse Forest","descriptions":["The path turns sharply here heading to either side of the ridge.  On a small hill to the northeast, a couple of large figures seem to be observing the path from a look-out platform built among the trees."],"exits":[{"to":37,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":39,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":39,"x":60,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Sparse Forest","descriptions":["The ridge is not very steep here, but dense undergrowth still prevents anyone from climbing it.  The trees are not as tall or as dense as in the lower forest, but there are still satinwoods and oaks mixed in with redbuds and dogwoods."],"exits":[{"to":38,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":40,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":40,"x":40,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Sparse Forest","descriptions":["The path begins to slip away from the ridge towards a small valley nestled between the mountains.  In the distance, a couple of smoke plumes rise above the forest before dissipating in the wind."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":39,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":41,"x":40,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Sparse Forest","descriptions":["There is a rustling sound in the undergrowth beyond a fallen tree.  Suddenly, up pops a squirrel.  He climbs up on the tree, stares around for a bit, then starts licking and cleaning his fur, pausing only to sniff at a tree beetle crawling nearby."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":42,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":42,"x":20,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Sparse Forest","descriptions":["An old wooden fence blocks the path continuing west.  A half-open gate barely hangs on a post with a couple of shredded leather hinges.  A gust of wind or a swift kick would probably knock the whole thing over."],"exits":[{"to":41,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":43,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}]},
  {"id":43,"x":-80,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Sparse Forest","descriptions":["The path crosses a large grassy clearing with a few scattered fire pits.  Off to one side, the bed of a wagon lies abandoned on the ground.  A broken axle and a couple of wheels are half-hidden in the taller grass nearby."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":42,"exit":"go","move":"go gate"}]},
  {"id":44,"x":-100,"y":-360,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Sparse Forest","descriptions":["Crickets and katydids fill the air with a hushed drone.  Occasionally, the muted hoots of owls and the flapping of wings break the sleepy peace of the forest night.  ","The chirping and chattering of hundreds of sparrows in the trees above is almost deafening.  Startled by something making noise in the bushes below, they suddenly take wing.  In several large groups, they fly in and around the trees before settling back down."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":45,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":45,"x":-120,"y":-380,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Sparse Forest","descriptions":["The trees and undergrowth are so thick that little can be seen beyond the faint path.  Ivy has grown at least part way up most of the trees, and sometimes between them, forming living veils."],"exits":[{"to":46,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":44,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":46,"x":-120,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Gully","descriptions":["An occasional glimpse of distant peaks can be caught through the leafy canopy to the north.  The sounds of birdsong are muted, with only a faint melody breaking the silence.  A dry streambed cuts across the forest floor, spanned by an old rope bridge that sways gently in the breeze."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":47,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"}]},
  {"id":47,"x":-120,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Wilderness, Rope Bridge","descriptions":["The bridge creaks ominously underfoot.  Jagged rocks fill the gully below, waiting for anyone foolish enough to tempt fate.  Rolling hills are evident to the north, while a wall of trees presents itself south of the bridge."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":46,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":48,"x":-120,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Sentry","descriptions":["A lone Gor'Tog stands motionless, his dark leathers rendering him almost indistinguishable from the surrounding underbrush.  The sentry's eyes scan constantly for signs of danger, the slightest movement instantly drawing his attention.  A low wooden building can be glimpsed off to the west, while to the north the thinning forest gives way to hills.  A rope bridge spans a dry gully south of here."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":49,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":47,"exit":"go","move":"go bridge"}]},
  {"id":49,"x":-140,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Wooden Shack","descriptions":["An array of weaponry, mostly clubs and spears, lean against the side of a dilapidated shack.  Muffled thumps from inside betray the presence of at least one occupant."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":50,"exit":"go","move":"go shack"}]},
  {"id":50,"x":-160,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Old Shack","descriptions":["Sagging cots are strewn about this tiny shack.  Off duty sentries catch a few precious moments of sleep while they await their shifts.  Only a few of the mattresses are presently occupied, but the sheer bulk of the slumbering guards is impressive."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":51,"x":-120,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Rolling Hills","descriptions":["This beaten dirt path threads its way over lightly wooded hills.  Outskirts of a small settlement can barely be made out to the north, against the backdrop of jagged peaks."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":48,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]},
  {"id":52,"x":-120,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Rolling Hills","descriptions":["Several fierce-looking Gor'Togs loiter about the entrance to a small cave.  Dressed in brightly dyed leathers and carrying an impressive amount of weaponry, the Gor'Togs appear ready for battle at a moment's notice.  The crackling of an open fire to the east fills the air."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":55,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":53,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":51,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":57,"exit":"go","move":"go cave"}]},
  {"id":53,"x":-100,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Woodland's Edge","descriptions":["Rolling hills give way to wooded plains, the sounds of the forest a welcome relief from the bustle of the Gor'Tog settlement to the north.  A beaten dirt path, worn from years of heavy use, leads deeper into the primeval wood."],"exits":[{"to":55,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":54,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":52,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":64,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}]},
  {"id":54,"x":-80,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Woodland's Edge","descriptions":["Wooden buildings, a rare sight among the many cave dwellings, huddle about a clear pond.  Though unadorned, their construction seems sound enough.  Fingers of grey smoke curl into the air from the top of an unobtrusive shop."],"exits":[{"to":63,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":53,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":55,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":56,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":70,"exit":"go","move":"go shop"}]},
  {"id":55,"x":-100,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Firepit","descriptions":["Scorching heat rises from a roaring bonfire at the center of this sandy pit.  A huge boar slowly rotates over the fire, sending the scent of burnt flesh wafting into the air.  An elderly Gor'Tog, immensely strong despite his years, turns the spit with a steady rhythm."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":54,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":53,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":52,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":56,"x":-100,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Rolling Hills","descriptions":["Caves honeycomb the rocky hills, providing shelter from the elements for the many warriors who inhabit the area.  Gor'Togs cluster about, yelling to one another in booming shouts.  Boisterous laughter splits the air, its origin impossible to determine.  One particularly large cave entrance draws the eye."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":55,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":52,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":59,"exit":"go","move":"go entr"}]},
  {"id":57,"x":-140,"y":-480,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Bukor's Leatherworks","descriptions":["Low tables are pushed up against bare rock walls in this natural cavern.  Carefully tanned furs and leathers are arranged haphazardly about the area, no thought having been given to a proper display.  Bukor, a Gor'Tog of great skill but suspect taste, is well known in the Clan for his temper.  He knows his work is excellent, and expects to be compensated accordingly."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":52,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Bukor's Leatherworks"]},
  {"id":58,"x":-120,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Back Room","descriptions":["A pine counter liberally spattered with a muddied rainbow of colors blocks passage deeper into the room.  Near a dark curtain at the back of the shop can be seen several barrels of pigmented metallic powders stacked carelessly next to a large bucket of half-dried paint.  Klurge, the proprieter of the operation, stands behind the counter, watching incoming customers with suspicious eyes.  A color menu list is nailed to the wall to the left of the exit."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Bukor's Leatherworks, Back Room"]},
  {"id":59,"x":-100,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Cavern","descriptions":["By far the largest cavern in Trefan Iltesh, this vast cave serves as both a central meeting place and, more frequently, as a giant arena.  Opponents square off in the middle of a roughly circular pit carved into the rocky floor while onlookers gather about the edge and hurl insults or cheers as their champions' fortunes change.  Smaller caverns breaking off from the main cave lead in several directions."],"exits":[{"to":62,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":60,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":56,"exit":"out","move":"out"},{"to":61,"exit":"go","move":"go cav"}]},
  {"id":60,"x":-80,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Cavern","descriptions":["The sharp CRACK! of clashing weaponry echoes madly through this rocky chamber.  Almost palpable waves of heat roll off grim-faced Gor'Togs as they flail at one another in preparation for their trials in the arena.  Despite their bulk, opponents dance nimbly through the natural obstacles formed by thrusting stalagmites.  A few heavy boulders have been pushed into one corner of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":61,"x":-120,"y":-520,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Triage","descriptions":["Low groans rising from the injured fill the cramped alcove as wounded hunters and warriors receive aid.  Mattresses line the walls, about half occupied by recovering patients.  The floor is almost entirely covered by a dark red stain, paying testament to the enthusiasm of the field surgeons.  An ominous bone saw leans against the wall, obviously a favorite method of treatment."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"color":"#80FF80","aliases":["TRIAGE"]},
  {"id":62,"x":-100,"y":-540,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Shrine","descriptions":["The dim light from a few flickering torches is not enough to cut through the gloom that pervades this cramped alcove.  The cold stone walls seem to close in on all sides.  Against the far wall leans a carved granite statue of a fierce weasel, its small size oddly out of place among the giant Gor'Togs that inhabit these caves."],"exits":[{"to":59,"exit":"south","move":"south"}],"color":"#80FF80","aliases":["Shrine to Huldah"]},
  {"id":63,"x":-60,"y":-500,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Rolling Hills","descriptions":["Towering mountains block out the sky and create a natural barrier protecting the Clan's flank.  A wrought-iron gate, undoubtedly imposing in any other setting, pales in comparison.  The portal seems oddly out of place amidst the rocky crags."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":64,"x":-100,"y":-440,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Woodland Trail","descriptions":["Gnarled branches claw at the air, and tangled roots seem intent on tripping the unwary.  The fresh spoor of large game is apparent, a sure sign of plentiful hunting.  A beaten dirt path leads back to the settlement."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":53,"exit":"go","move":"go path"}]},
  {"id":65,"x":-80,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Primeval Glade","descriptions":["A circular clearing has been carved out of the dense wood, the lumber apparently used to construct the cabin that fills most of this break in the forest.  Constant battle is obviously waged to prevent the surrounding underbrush from encroaching into the area."],"exits":[{"to":68,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":69,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":67,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":66,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":64,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":66,"x":-100,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Woodlands","descriptions":["The wind lends a biting chill to the air as it whips through the trees.  An eerie whistling originates from some oddly-shaped reeds.  Perhaps because of the sound, wildlife seems to avoid this area."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":67,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":67,"x":-80,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Woodlands","descriptions":["Ancient trees soar skyward here in the heart of the primeval forest.  The mammoth trunks dwarf even the Gor'Tog hunters that frequent the glade in search of game.  One blackened stump pays testament to the violent storms that sometimes frequent these lands."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":68,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":69,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":66,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":68,"x":-60,"y":-420,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Deep Forest's Edge","descriptions":["A few taffelberry bushes have managed to find a niche here in the shadow of looming trees.  From the bushes' rather barren appearance, the local wildlife has acquired quite a taste for the sweet berries."],"exits":[{"to":69,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":67,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":65,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":69,"x":-60,"y":-400,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Deep Forest's Edge","descriptions":["Pale grey mosses grow in curtains among clustered trees.  A black squirrel chirrs happily to himself as he scampers across an overhead limb.  With a heroic leap, the squirrel hurls himself through the air, only to land triumphantly moments later on a distant branch."],"exits":[{"to":68,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":67,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":65,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":70,"x":-60,"y":-460,"z":0,"title":"Knife Clan, Tobb's Smithy","descriptions":["Knives of all shapes, sizes, and descriptions occupy every available surface in this tiny shop.  Care must be taken to avoid any sudden movement, or painful consequences may result.  But despite the eccentricity of his establishment, Tobb the smith is almost revered by his patrons for the detailed craftsmanship with which he goes about his work."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"out","move":"out"}],"color":"#FF0000","aliases":["Knife Clan Weapons"]}
 ],
 "labels": [
  {"text":"To Westgate Area","x":-110,"y":10,"z":0},
  {"text":"Knife Clan","x":-170,"y":-550,"z":0}
 ]
}
